      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "@RebelMike in regards to the 6 through hold mezzanine gnd pins:\ndoes this apply for the quarter slot ? \n\nSince I have 2 additional layers I can add to make this a 4 layer PCB, I am thinking I can make these extra layers entirely GND, which would likely give us plenty of ground connection. \n\n> but use 6 through holes to provide a good ground connection to each mezzanine ground pin\n\nDo you guys think this would be a bad idea ? Not just asking Mike, anyone else fell free to speak up.",
