      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Interestingly Claude said:\n\nOn price, the LXW part costs about $0.11 in volume, while the HCTL is about $0.36. The genuine Hirose DF40C-60DP-0.4V(51) is only about $0.38 on LCSC with around 15.8k in stock. So the HCTL clone saves you almost nothing over the real Hirose part.",
