    {
      "id": "1553651109216657480",
      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-27T06:14:49.879+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "We can do but keep in mind while using cheaper connectors is easy, changing the board from 70 to 60 pin is some work: board redesign, adaptor for testing, fw for testing, probably other things too.\n\nInterested to hear others' opinions about this too",
